---
id: router.request
version: 1.4.0
role: router
locale: ar
changelog:
  - "1.0.0: first version (phase 04): the conversation's file names and the message, as data in the user role (ADR-0068)"
  - "1.1.0: file names escaped, so a name cannot close the block (owner decision S2)"
  - "1.2.0: the candidate skills, their descriptions and when to use them, when the message holds a skill keyword (phase 06, ADR-0299)"
  - "1.3.0: a candidate skill is listed with its description only; in the open Agent Skills format the description says when to use it (ADR-0317)"
  - "1.4.0: on a report candidate, the conversation's current report title, escaped (reports PR, ADR-0378)"
---
<conversation_files>
{% for name in files %}
- {{ name | e }}
{% endfor %}
</conversation_files>
{% if skills %}
<candidate_skills>
{% for s in skills %}
- {{ s.slug }}: {{ s.description | e }}
{% endfor %}
</candidate_skills>
{% endif %}
{% if report_candidate is defined and report_candidate %}
<report_option current="{{ (current_report if current_report is defined and current_report else '') | e }}"/>
{% endif %}
<user_message>
{{ message }}
</user_message>
